    "id": "brechschnell",
    "title": "BrechSchnell",
    "category": "bicycles",
    "period": "2025",
    "status": "In Use",
    "description": "A Gravel bicycle built primarily with components sourced from aliexpress; notable components are the 11-speed LTWOO drivetrain and the TRP HYRD brake calipers. \n\nThe inspiration for the paintwork stemmed from the fact that the frame vendor had used multiple A4 sheets of chinese stamps to cover the postage fee. \n\nThe Green-Gold colors reference the Chinese Postal Service (China Post), the beige and red colors represent packaging and shipping labels. The stamps were integrated into the paintwork and continue to travel together with the frame.\n",
